It seems there was a misunderstanding in the response format. As an owner, I should not have used a JSON response to indicate my action. Instead, I should have used the provided announcement tools to communicate my decision. Let me correct that by making the appropriate announcement in the public board.

I will now post the correct announcement using the provided tool.

```
{
  "type": "function",
  "function": {
    "name": "announce_action",
    "description": "Publicly announce the action you intend to take in THIS block. Non-binding; your actual action is committed in the execution phase.",
    "parameters": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "action": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "charge",
            "discharge",
            "hold"
          ]
