```json
{
    "name": "announce_action",
    "arguments": {
        "action": "charge",
        "amount": 10
    }
}
```

- Since this is a simulation and the execution phase is being described, you will now proceed to simulate the action of charging 10 MWh into your battery, preparing for the next pricing block.

